{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.PhiQPiece","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Finset.Card","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":13,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.subLink_empty","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.subLink_empty","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L63-L67","doc":"The empty piece `K_∅` is the trivial unlink; its hyperbolic volume\nis zero by convention. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.subLink","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.subLink","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L48-L61","doc":"The Φ_q-piece `K_S` of a braid `β`: the closure of the sub-braid\nobtained by deleting (= replacing by the identity strand) every\ncrossing whose index is **not** in `S`.\n\nThis is the abstract specification; the geometric construction\n(Kauffman L₀-smoothing of the diagram) is recorded in the\naccompanying `.md` file. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:phi-q-piece","label":"def:phi-q-piece","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/phi-q-piece.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.SubLink.hypVolume_nonneg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.SubLink.hypVolume_nonneg","kind":"theorem","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L46-L46","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.SubLink.hypVolume","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.SubLink.hypVolume","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L45-L45","doc":"Hyperbolic volume of `S³ \\ K_S` (zero when the complement is not\nhyperbolic, by the convention recorded in the .md file). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.SubLink.name","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.SubLink.name","kind":"def","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.SubLink.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.SubLink.mk","kind":"ctor","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.SubLink","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.SubLink","kind":"structure","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L37-L46","doc":"Abstract sub-link type carrying a name and a (placeholder) topological\ninvariant.  In the formal development this is replaced by the actual\nsub-link `K_S ⊆ S³`; here it is kept abstract because the volume\nonly enters through the Kashaev volume conjecture class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.instReprBraid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.instReprBraid","kind":"instance","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.instReprBraid.repr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.instReprBraid.repr","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L35-L35","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.Braid.word","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.Braid.word","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L34-L34","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.Braid.n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.Braid.n","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L33-L33","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.Braid.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.Braid.mk","kind":"ctor","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L32-L32","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.PhiQPiece.Braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.PhiQPiece.Braid","kind":"structure","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/PhiQPiece.lean#L29-L35","doc":"Abstract braid: a finite list of (signed) Hecke-generator indices.\n`n` is the number of strands; each generator index is a `Fin (n-1)`.\nA negative crossing carries `Bool = true`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}